      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La vieja «nodriza» fue a visitar a Sémele, y la princesa se alegró de verla.",
          "en": "The old \"nurse\" came to visit Semele, and the princess was happy to see her."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hablaron mucho tiempo, del bebé y de su padre.",
          "en": "They talked for a long time, about the baby and about its father."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¿Dice que es Zeus?», preguntó la anciana. «Muchos hombres dicen eso, hija mía».",
          "en": "\"He says he is Zeus?\" asked the old woman. \"Many men say that, my child.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "«Pídele una prueba. Pídele que venga a ti como va con Hera, con todo su poder».",
          "en": "\"Ask him for proof. Ask him to come to you as he comes to Hera, in all his power.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Sémele empezó a dudar. Y esa duda era todo lo que Hera necesitaba.",
          "en": "Semele began to doubt. And that doubt was all Hera needed."
        }
      ],
